    "summary": "Use it in either player's Command phase on 1 **ADEPTA SORORITAS** unit of yours. It is blessed for the rest of the turn.\n\nA blessed unit may disregard some or all modifiers to:\n\n- its models' characteristics\n- the WS or BS of weapons its models carry\n- rolls and tests made for it, except saving throws\n\nIf the target is a **JUMP PACK** unit, each friendly **ADEPTA SORORITAS** unit within 3\" of it is also blessed for the rest of the turn.",
